{"seq":4,"slug":"security-audit","title":"安全审计与日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/security-audit","wordCount":1322,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"安全审计与日志\">安全审计与日志</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>安全审计（Security Audit）是系统化地记录、分析和评估安全相关事件的过程。在云环境中，审计日志是合规要求的基本条件，也是安全事件调查和根因分析的关键数据源。一个完善的审计体系需要回答三个核心问题：<strong>谁</strong>（Who）在<strong>什么时间</strong>（When）对<strong>什么资源</strong>（What）做了<strong>什么操作</strong>（Action），以及<strong>结果</strong>（Outcome）如何。</p>\n<p>AWS CloudTrail 是云安全审计的核心服务，记录 AWS 账户中的所有 API 调用。结合 CloudWatch Logs、VPC Flow Logs、S3 Access Logs 和 GuardDuty，构成完整的安全审计体系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 审计数据源&#10;        A[CloudTrail: API调用]&#10;        B[CloudWatch Logs: 应用日志]&#10;        C[VPC Flow Logs: 网络流量]&#10;        D[S3 Access Logs: 对象访问]&#10;        E[WAF Logs: Web攻击]&#10;        F[GuardDuty: 威胁检测]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 集中存储&#10;        G[S3 审计桶]&#10;        H[CloudWatch Log Group]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 分析查询&#10;        I[Athena SQL查询]&#10;        J[CloudWatch Insights]&#10;        K[Security Hub]&#10;        L[OpenSearch/SIEM]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; G&#10;    B --&gt; H&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    A --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    F --&gt; K&#10;    G --&gt; L\">graph TB\n    subgraph 审计数据源\n        A[CloudTrail: API调用]\n        B[CloudWatch Logs: 应用日志]\n        C[VPC Flow Logs: 网络流量]\n        D[S3 Access Logs: 对象访问]\n        E[WAF Logs: Web攻击]\n        F[GuardDuty: 威胁检测]\n    end\n    subgraph 集中存储\n        G[S3 审计桶]\n        H[CloudWatch Log Group]\n    end\n    subgraph 分析查询\n        I[Athena SQL查询]\n        J[CloudWatch Insights]\n        K[Security Hub]\n        L[OpenSearch/SIEM]\n    end\n    A --&gt; G\n    B --&gt; H\n    C --&gt; G\n    D --&gt; G\n    A --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; J\n    F --&gt; K\n    G --&gt; L</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>日志类型</th>\n<th>记录内容</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>保留策略</th>\n<th>合规需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CloudTrail 管理事件</td>\n<td>控制面 API 调用</td>\n<td>S3 + CloudWatch</td>\n<td>≥90 天（免费）</td>\n<td>所有框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CloudTrail 数据事件</td>\n<td>数据面操作（S3 读写等）</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>按合规要求</td>\n<td>PCI DSS, HIPAA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VPC Flow Logs</td>\n<td>网络流量元数据</td>\n<td>S3 / CloudWatch</td>\n<td>30-90 天</td>\n<td>PCI DSS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 Server Access Logs</td>\n<td>S3 桶级访问记录</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>按合规要求</td>\n<td>GDPR, SOC 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALB Access Logs</td>\n<td>HTTP 请求日志</td>\n<td>S3</td>\n<td>按合规要求</td>\n<td>SOC 2, PCI DSS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAF Logs</td>\n<td>Web 攻击检测</td>\n<td>S3 / CloudWatch / Firehose</td>\n<td>30-90 天</td>\n<td>PCI DSS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cloudtrail-深入配置\">CloudTrail 深入配置</h2><p>AWS CloudTrail 记录账户中几乎所有的 API 调用，包括 AWS Management Console、AWS SDK、CLI 和其他 AWS 服务发起的调用。CloudTrail 是安全审计的基石。</p>\n<p><strong>Trail 配置</strong>：每个 AWS 账户有一个默认的事件历史（Event History），保留 90 天的管理事件。要长期保留和分析日志，需要创建 Trail 并配置 S3 存储。</p>\n<p><strong>多账户集中审计</strong>：在 AWS Organizations 中创建组织 Trail，自动收集所有成员账户的 CloudTrail 日志到安全账户的 S3 桶。这是多账户安全架构的基本配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { CloudTrailClient, CreateTrailCommand, PutEventSelectorsCommand } from &#39;@aws-sdk/client-cloudtrail&#39;;&#10;&#10;const ct = new CloudTrailClient({});&#10;&#10;await ct.send(&#10;  new CreateTrailCommand({&#10;    Name: &#39;organization-trail&#39;,&#10;    S3BucketName: &#39;security-audit-logs-123456789012&#39;,&#10;    S3KeyPrefix: &#39;cloudtrail&#39;,&#10;    IsMultiRegionTrail: true,&#10;    IsOrganizationTrail: true,&#10;    EnableLogFileValidation: true,&#10;    KmsKeyId: &#39;arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:123456789012:key/audit-key&#39;,&#10;    CloudWatchLogsLogGroupArn: &#39;arn:aws:logs:us-east-1:123456789012:log-group:cloudtrail:*&#39;,&#10;    CloudWatchLogsRoleArn: &#39;arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/CloudTrailToCloudWatch&#39;,&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;&#10;await ct.send(&#10;  new PutEventSelectorsCommand({&#10;    TrailName: &#39;organization-trail&#39;,&#10;    AdvancedEventSelectors: [&#10;      {&#10;        Name: &#39;S3DataEvents&#39;,&#10;        FieldSelectors: [&#10;          { Field: &#39;eventCategory&#39;, Equals: [&#39;Data&#39;] },&#10;          { Field: &#39;resources.type&#39;, Equals: [&#39;AWS::S3::Object&#39;] },&#10;          {&#10;            Field: &#39;resources.ARN&#39;,&#10;            StartsWith: [&#39;arn:aws:s3:::sensitive-data-bucket/&#39;],&#10;          },&#10;        ],&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { CloudTrailClient, CreateTrailCommand, PutEventSelectorsCommand } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@aws-sdk/client-cloudtrail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ct</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CloudTrailClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ct.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CreateTrailCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'organization-trail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    S3BucketName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'security-audit-logs-123456789012'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    S3KeyPrefix: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cloudtrail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    IsMultiRegionTrail: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    IsOrganizationTrail: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EnableLogFileValidation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    KmsKeyId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:123456789012:key/audit-key'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CloudWatchLogsLogGroupArn: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'arn:aws:logs:us-east-1:123456789012:log-group:cloudtrail:*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CloudWatchLogsRoleArn: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'arn:aws:iam::123456789012:role/CloudTrailToCloudWatch'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ct.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PutEventSelectorsCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TrailName: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'organization-trail'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    AdvancedEventSelectors: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'S3DataEvents'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        FieldSelectors: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { Field: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'eventCategory'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Equals: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Data'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { Field: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resources.type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Equals: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AWS::S3::Object'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Field: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resources.ARN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            StartsWith: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'arn:aws:s3:::sensitive-data-bucket/'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>日志完整性验证</strong>：CloudTrail 启用日志文件验证（Log File Validation）后，每小时生成一个摘要文件（Digest File），包含该小时内所有日志文件的 SHA-256 哈希。可以验证日志是否被篡改——这对于法律取证和合规审计至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>关键安全事件监控</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>事件名称</th>\n<th>严重性</th>\n<th>响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Root 账户登录</td>\n<td>ConsoleLogin (root)</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>即时告警 + 调查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IAM 策略变更</td>\n<td>AttachUserPolicy, PutRolePolicy</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>告警 + 审批流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全组变更</td>\n<td>AuthorizeSecurityGroupIngress</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>告警 + 变更审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 桶策略变更</td>\n<td>PutBucketPolicy</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>告警 + 访问审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密钥创建</td>\n<td>CreateAccessKey</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>告警 + 合规检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CloudTrail 停止</td>\n<td>StopLogging</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>即时告警 + 恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KMS 密钥删除</td>\n<td>ScheduleKeyDeletion</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>即时告警 + 取消</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"athena-日志分析\">Athena 日志分析</h2><p>Amazon Athena 是 Serverless 的 SQL 查询引擎，可以直接查询 S3 中的 CloudTrail 日志。无需 ETL 或数据导入，按扫描的数据量计费（$5/TB）。</p>\n<p><strong>创建 CloudTrail 日志表</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE EXTERNAL TABLE cloudtrail_logs (&#10;    eventVersion STRING,&#10;    userIdentity STRUCT&lt;&#10;        type: STRING,&#10;        principalId: STRING,&#10;        arn: STRING,&#10;        accountId: STRING,&#10;        invokedBy: STRING,&#10;        accessKeyId: STRING,&#10;        userName: STRING,&#10;        sessionContext: STRUCT&lt;&#10;            attributes: STRUCT&lt;mfaAuthenticated: STRING, creationDate: STRING&gt;,&#10;            sessionIssuer: STRUCT&lt;type: STRING, principalId: STRING, arn: STRING, accountId: STRING, userName: STRING&gt;&#10;        &gt;&#10;    &gt;,&#10;    eventTime STRING,&#10;    eventSource STRING,&#10;    eventName STRING,&#10;    awsRegion STRING,&#10;    sourceIPAddress STRING,&#10;    userAgent STRING,&#10;    errorCode STRING,&#10;    errorMessage STRING,&#10;    requestParameters STRING,&#10;    responseElements STRING,&#10;    resources ARRAY&lt;STRUCT&lt;arn: STRING, accountId: STRING, type: STRING&gt;&gt;&#10;)&#10;PARTITIONED BY (region STRING, year STRING, month STRING, day STRING)&#10;ROW FORMAT SERDE &#39;org.apache.hive.hcatalog.data.JsonSerDe&#39;&#10;LOCATION &#39;s3://security-audit-logs/cloudtrail/AWSLogs/123456789012/&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXTERNAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cloudtrail_logs (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    eventVersion STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    userIdentity STRUCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        principalId: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        arn: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        accountId: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        invokedBy: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        accessKeyId: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        userName: STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sessionContext: STRUCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attributes: STRUCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mfaAuthenticated: STRING, creationDate: STRING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sessionIssuer: STRUCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: STRING, principalId: STRING, arn: STRING, accountId: STRING, userName: STRING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    eventTime STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    eventSource STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    eventName STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    awsRegion STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sourceIPAddress STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    userAgent STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    errorCode STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    errorMessage STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    requestParameters STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    responseElements STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resources </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ARRAY&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">STRUCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">arn: STRING, accountId: STRING, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: STRING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PARTITIONED </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (region STRING, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STRING, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STRING, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">day</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> STRING)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FORMAT SERDE </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'org.apache.hive.hcatalog.data.JsonSerDe'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LOCATION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's3://security-audit-logs/cloudtrail/AWSLogs/123456789012/'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常用安全查询</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查找未使用MFA的控制台登录&#10;SELECT eventTime, userIdentity.userName, sourceIPAddress&#10;FROM cloudtrail_logs&#10;WHERE eventName = &#39;ConsoleLogin&#39;&#10;  AND userIdentity.sessionContext.attributes.mfaAuthenticated = &#39;false&#39;&#10;  AND eventTime &gt; date_add(&#39;day&#39;, -7, current_date)&#10;ORDER BY eventTime DESC;&#10;&#10;-- 查找异常的跨区域API调用&#10;SELECT awsRegion, COUNT(*) as call_count, userIdentity.arn&#10;FROM cloudtrail_logs&#10;WHERE awsRegion NOT IN (&#39;us-east-1&#39;, &#39;eu-west-1&#39;)&#10;  AND errorCode IS NULL&#10;GROUP BY awsRegion, userIdentity.arn&#10;ORDER BY call_count DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查找未使用MFA的控制台登录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventTime, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">userIdentity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">userName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sourceIPAddress</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cloudtrail_logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventName </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ConsoleLogin'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> userIdentity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sessionContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mfaAuthenticated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'false'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_add(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, current_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventTime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查找异常的跨区域API调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> awsRegion, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_count, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">userIdentity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">arn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cloudtrail_logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> awsRegion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'us-east-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'eu-west-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errorCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> awsRegion, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">userIdentity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">arn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"siem-集成与自动化响应\">SIEM 集成与自动化响应</h2><p>安全信息与事件管理（SIEM）系统将多个日志源的数据集中分析，通过关联规则和机器学习检测安全威胁。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Security Lake</strong> 是 AWS 的安全数据湖服务。它将 CloudTrail、VPC Flow Logs、Route 53 DNS 日志、Security Hub 发现等安全数据标准化为 OCSF（Open Cybersecurity Schema Framework）格式，存储在 S3 中。支持与第三方 SIEM（Splunk、Datadog、Sumo Logic）集成。</p>\n<p><strong>自动化安全响应</strong>（Security Orchestration, Automation and Response, SOAR）通过预定义的 Playbook 自动响应安全事件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[GuardDuty发现] --&gt; B[EventBridge规则]&#10;    B --&gt; C{严重性}&#10;    C --&gt;|高| D[Lambda: 自动隔离]&#10;    C --&gt;|中| E[SNS: 通知安全团队]&#10;    C --&gt;|低| F[Security Hub: 记录]&#10;    D --&gt; G[隔离实例]&#10;    D --&gt; H[撤销密钥]&#10;    D --&gt; I[创建工单]\">graph LR\n    A[GuardDuty发现] --&gt; B[EventBridge规则]\n    B --&gt; C{严重性}\n    C --&gt;|高| D[Lambda: 自动隔离]\n    C --&gt;|中| E[SNS: 通知安全团队]\n    C --&gt;|低| F[Security Hub: 记录]\n    D --&gt; G[隔离实例]\n    D --&gt; H[撤销密钥]\n    D --&gt; I[创建工单]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SIEM 方案</th>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>日志源支持</th>\n<th>自动响应</th>\n<th>价格模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Security Hub</td>\n<td>AWS 托管</td>\n<td>AWS 原生</td>\n<td>EventBridge + Lambda</td>\n<td>按发现数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Security Lake</td>\n<td>AWS 托管</td>\n<td>OCSF 标准化</td>\n<td>与 SIEM 集成</td>\n<td>按存储+查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Splunk Cloud</td>\n<td>SaaS</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n<td>Phantom SOAR</td>\n<td>按摄入量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elastic SIEM</td>\n<td>自建/Cloud</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n<td>内建</td>\n<td>按节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Datadog Security</td>\n<td>SaaS</td>\n<td>全面</td>\n<td>Workflow Automation</td>\n<td>按日志量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"审计报告与合规证明\">审计报告与合规证明</h2><p>安全审计的最终产出是审计报告和合规证明。不同的合规框架对审计报告有不同的要求。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Artifact</strong> 是下载 AWS 合规报告和协议的门户。可以下载 AWS 的 SOC 1/2/3 报告、PCI DSS AOC、ISO 27001 证书、HIPAA BAA 等。这些报告证明 AWS 基础设施层面的合规性，用户需要自行证明应用层的合规性。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Audit Manager</strong> 自动收集审计证据。预建框架映射（PCI DSS、SOC 2、GDPR、HIPAA 等）自动关联 AWS Config 规则、CloudTrail 事件和 Security Hub 发现到具体的合规控制项。生成可供审计师审查的证据包。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合规工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS Artifact</td>\n<td>下载 AWS 合规报告</td>\n<td>SOC/PCI/ISO 报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Audit Manager</td>\n<td>自动收集审计证据</td>\n<td>证据包 + 评估报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Config Conformance Pack</td>\n<td>合规规则集</td>\n<td>合规/不合规状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Security Hub Standards</td>\n<td>安全标准检查</td>\n<td>CIS/PCI 合规分数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CloudTrail 是安全审计的基石，记录所有 API 调用，多账户集中到安全账户</li>\n<li>启用日志文件验证（SHA-256 Digest）确保日志完整性，支持法律取证</li>\n<li>关键安全事件必须实时告警：Root 登录、IAM 变更、CloudTrail 停止</li>\n<li>Athena 直接查询 S3 中的 CloudTrail 日志，无需 ETL，按扫描量计费</li>\n<li>Security Lake 标准化安全数据为 OCSF 格式，支持第三方 SIEM 集成</li>\n<li>自动化响应：GuardDuty → EventBridge → Lambda（隔离/撤销/通知）</li>\n<li>Audit Manager 自动收集合规证据，映射到 PCI DSS/SOC 2/GDPR 等框架</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"安全审计与日志","id":"安全审计与日志"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CloudTrail 深入配置","id":"cloudtrail-深入配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Athena 日志分析","id":"athena-日志分析"},{"level":2,"text":"SIEM 集成与自动化响应","id":"siem-集成与自动化响应"},{"level":2,"text":"审计报告与合规证明","id":"审计报告与合规证明"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合规即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/compliance-as-code"},"next":{"title":"策略即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-security-compliance/compliance-frameworks/policy-as-code"}}